{"title": "Lay Bare Their Weakness", "pageid": 28317, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lay_Bare_Their_Weakness", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Lay Bare Their Weakness</b> is a passive feature that increases the difficulty to resist the wearer's spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After dealing damage with an unarmed attack, the wearer gains a +1 bonus to their <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">spell save DC</a> until the end of their turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Those_Laid_Bare\"> Condition: Those Laid Bare </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Those_Laid_Bare_(Condition)\" title=\"Those Laid Bare (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Slam_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Slam_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Slam_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Slam_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Slam_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Slam_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Those Laid Bare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Slam_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Slam_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Slam_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Those_Laid_Bare_(Condition)\" title=\"Those Laid Bare (Condition)\">Those Laid Bare</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +1 bonus to save against <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">spell DC</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hat_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo\">Hat of Uninhibited Kushigo</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This only triggers on melee unarmed attacks, not on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Though seemingly a great choice for <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Four_Elements\" title=\"Way of the Four Elements\">Way of the Four Elements</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Disciplines\" title=\"Elemental Disciplines\">Elemental Disciplines</a>, the effect only lasts until the beginning of the wearer's next turn and as a result requires <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows\" title=\"Flurry of Blows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/20px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/30px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/40px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flurry of Blows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/20px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows\" title=\"Flurry of Blows\">Flurry of Blows</a> to trigger each turn before the use of an action with a saving throw.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202325\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1714/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15683/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4827/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979939/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.935      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   48.935      1 -total\n 33.51%   16.400      1 Template:Condition\n 25.90%   12.673      3 Template:Icon_link\n 24.95%   12.209      3 Template:Icon_text\n 24.22%   11.854      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n 23.92%   11.707     14 Template:Trim\n 20.48%   10.020      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 17.79%    8.706      5 Template:Ifempty\n 16.24%    7.946      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28317-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202325 and revision id 389154. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}